            "testimonial_text": "As a fellow creative professional, I have high standards when it comes to design. Kelola not only met but exceeded those standards. Their approach to our website redesign was nothing short of brilliant."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "customer_name": "Thomas Gala",
            "customer_title": "Founder ZenTech Wellness",
            "testimonial_text": "In the fast-paced world of tech, it's crucial to have a creative partner who can keep up with our innovative ideas. Kelola not only kept up but exceeded our expectations."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}